        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweepminer</strong> is a collection of 7 Minesweeper-inspired microgames made for quick sessions and simple fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode puts a tiny spin on the familiar idea—some add movement, others change the rules—but they’re all easy to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most games can be finished in a few minutes, no long tutorials but light puzzles for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/5d2bcedfb3b532d4c5040dd6674f594e.poster.avif?t=1764700533\" width=432 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/5d2bcedfb3b532d4c5040dd6674f594e.webm?t=1764700533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/5d2bcedfb3b532d4c5040dd6674f594e.mp4?t=1764700533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/2dbd623a782c9b1c80e3a26a1938a2e7.avif?t=1764700533\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/1cf1f0873c853e83822c06c646783828.poster.avif?t=1764700533\" width=432 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/1cf1f0873c853e83822c06c646783828.webm?t=1764700533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/1cf1f0873c853e83822c06c646783828.mp4?t=1764700533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/ac9fcd3213825dad745f913f1912b6b8.avif?t=1764700533\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/6a5c52203deed2fb7e25853d691ff5f3.poster.avif?t=1764700533\" width=432 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/6a5c52203deed2fb7e25853d691ff5f3.webm?t=1764700533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/6a5c52203deed2fb7e25853d691ff5f3.mp4?t=1764700533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing collection of short, self-contained microgames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast restarts and quick sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, colorful visuals with a retro touch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully playable with the mouse (keyboard optional)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweepminer</strong> offers a cozy little detour through familiar ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906680/extras/07f1fc2cfd28d7e5bb6214e808cfe075.avif?t=1764700533\" width=64 height=64 /></span> <strong>Happy sweeping !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— <i>Étienne Pouvreau / smolware</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
